if(typeof require==='function'){var Constants=require('./constants');var Weapon=require('./weapon');var ProjectileState=require('./projectilestate');var IdGenerator=require('./idgenerator');}var BulletWeapon=Weapon.subclass();BulletWeapon.fields({_numBullets:0,_triggerPulled:false,_bulletsFired:0,_timeAlive:0.0});BulletWeapon.classMethods({createInitialWeaponState:function(id,playerId,numBullets){var fields={_numBullets:numBullets,_triggerPulled:false,_bulletsFired:0,_timeAlive:0.0};return Weapon.createInitialWeaponState(id,playerId,Constants.WEAPON_TYPES.BULLET,JSON.stringify(fields));}});BulletWeapon.methods({fire:function(){if(!this._triggerPulled){this._triggerPulled=true;if(this._bulletsFired<this._numBullets){++this._bulletsFired;this._emitEvent(Weapon._EVENTS.WEAPON_FIRED,this);return true;}else{this._emitEvent(Weapon._EVENTS.WEAPON_EMPTY,this);}}return false;},getProjectileStates:function(tank){var speedModifier=this.roundModel.getModifier(tank.getPlayerId(),Constants.MODIFIER_TYPES.SPEED);var projectileState=ProjectileState.withState(IdGenerator.instance.gen('b'),tank.getPlayerId(),Constants.WEAPON_TYPES.BULLET,tank.getX()+Math.sin(tank.getRotation())*Constants.BULLET.OFFSET.m,tank.getY()-Math.cos(tank.getRotation())*Constants.BULLET.OFFSET.m,Math.sin(tank.getRotation())*Constants.BULLET.SPEED.m*speedModifier,-Math.cos(tank.getRotation())*Constants.BULLET.SPEED.m*speedModifier);return[projectileState];},getTrapStates:function(tank){return[];},release:function(){this._triggerPulled=false;},reload:function(projectile){if(this._timeAlive>=projectile.getTimeAlive()){--this._bulletsFired;}},movementLocked:function(){return false;},update:function(deltaTime){this._timeAlive+=deltaTime;},done:function(){return false;},isDefault:function(){return true;}});if(typeof module==='object'){module.exports=BulletWeapon;}